{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CeuosByf94Wmxa4YcVmt7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Command:** `./mvnw test` from `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-9674b873-aa5b-4d8e-8923-854b1ed4eace/sample-service`\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS\n\n**Failures:** None — all 20 tests passed (10 OrderControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests, 6 ShipmentControllerTest, 3 CustomerControllerTest)\n\n**Tests verified:**\n- Existing order tests still pass (create, read, list, error cases)\n- Existing shipment tests still pass (create, read, list, error cases)\n- New cancel endpoint tests all pass\n- New shipment creation rejection test passes\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. **Existing build passes** → `./mvnw test` returned BUILD SUCCESS ✓\n2. **Existing tests pass** → All 20 tests pass, including all baseline tests from OrderControllerTest, ShipmentControllerTest, CustomerControllerTest ✓\n3. **POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel cancels an active order, persists it, and cancels CREATED shipments** → Tests: `cancels an ACTIVE order and returns it with CANCELLED status` and `cancelling an order cancels all its CREATED shipments` ✓\n4. **Error responses are consistent** → Uses ResourceNotFoundException (404) and ConflictException (409) caught by GlobalExceptionHandler, returns ApiError envelope with code and message ✓\n5. **Repeated cancel succeeds; blocked by CONFIRMED changes nothing; unknown order refused; shipment for cancelled order refused**:\n   - Repeated cancel succeeds unchanged: `cancelling an already CANCELLED order succeeds and changes nothing` ✓\n   - Blocked by CONFIRMED, changes nothing: `returns 409 when cancelling order with CONFIRMED shipment and changes nothing` ✓\n   - Unknown order refused: `returns 404 when cancelling non-existent order with error envelope` ✓\n   - Shipment for cancelled order refused: `rejects a shipment for a cancelled order with error envelope` ✓\n6. **No new Maven dependency appears** → No changes to pom.xml ✓\n7. **No unrelated production file changes** → Changed only: Order.kt, OrderStatus enum, OrderController.kt, OrderRepository (no changes needed), ShipmentRepository.kt (added findByOrderId), ShipmentController.kt, ApiError.kt, and corresponding tests ✓\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **Order.kt** — Added `status: OrderStatus = OrderStatus.ACTIVE` field to Order, added OrderStatus enum with ACTIVE and CANCELLED. Required for feature. ✓\n\n2. **OrderController.kt** — Added ShipmentRepository dependency injection, added `cancel()` endpoint implementing:\n   - Find order or 404\n   - Return unchanged if already CANCELLED (idempotent)\n   - Check for CONFIRMED shipments → 409 if found\n   - Cancel order and all CREATED shipments\n   Required for feature. ✓\n\n3. **ShipmentRepository.kt** — Added `findByOrderId()` method. Required to query shipments during cancel operation. ✓\n\n4. **ShipmentController.kt** — Added OrderRepository dependency injection, added check in create() to reject shipment creation for CANCELLED orders with 409. Required per ticket requirement. ✓\n\n5. **ApiError.kt** — Added two error codes: ORDER_CANCELLED and CANNOT_CANCEL_ORDER_WITH_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT. Required for error responses. ✓\n\n6. **OrderControllerTest.kt** — Added 6 new tests covering all cancel scenarios and shipment cancellation behavior. Tests for status field added. ✓\n\n7. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added 1 new test for rejection of shipment creation on cancelled order. Reset method updated to clear both repositories. ✓\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria met. All test cases specified in design covered by tests. All three implementation paths (cancel, shipment checks) implemented correctly. Error handling consistent with existing patterns.\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement: Add POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint with proper state management, shipment cancellation, all-or-nothing semantics, and rejection of shipment creation for cancelled orders.\n\nChanged:\n- Order.kt: Added status field (OrderStatus enum) to track order lifecycle (ACTIVE→CANCELLED)\n- OrderController.kt: Added cancel endpoint with idempotent behavior, CONFIRMED shipment check, and CREATED shipment cancellation\n- ShipmentRepository.kt: Added findByOrderId() method to query shipments by order\n- ShipmentController.kt: Added validation to reject shipment creation for cancelled orders\n- ApiError.kt: Added ORDER_CANCELLED and CANNOT_CANCEL_ORDER_WITH_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT error codes\n- OrderControllerTest.kt: Added 6 new tests covering cancel behavior, status field, and all error cases\n- ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added 1 test for shipment rejection on cancelled order; updated reset to clear both repositories\n\nTests:\n- New order status field defaults to ACTIVE for all newly created orders\n- Cancel ACTIVE order → 200 OK with status=CANCELLED\n- Cancel already CANCELLED order → 200 OK unchanged (idempotent)\n- Cancel with CONFIRMED shipment → 409 Conflict, order stays ACTIVE, shipment unchanged (all-or-nothing)\n- Cancel non-existent order → 404 Not Found\n- Cancel ACTIVE order → all CREATED shipments transition to CANCELLED\n- Create shipment for CANCELLED order → 409 Conflict\n- Create shipment for non-existent order → 201 (unchanged behavior per ticket)\n- All existing tests pass (backward compatibility)\n\nVerification: `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ returned BUILD SUCCESS with 20 tests passed (0 failures)\n\nNot done: None — all acceptance criteria implemented, tested, and verified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3318,"cache_read_input_tokens":36377,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3318},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_avail